sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Client
    participant B as Bank Agent (leader)
    participant I as Informations Agent
    participant A as Actions Agent

    Note over C,A: An operation is paused (input-required) and the client clicks a button
    C->>B: confirmation { decision }

    alt No pending confirmation (superseded by a new message)
        Note over B: src/agent/bankAgent.ts:215
        B-->>C: 409 "No operation is waiting for confirmation"
    else Network error while sending the decision
        B--xA: SendMessage (taskId, decision)
        Note over B: pendingConfirmation kept, retry is safe<br/>src/agent/bankAgent.ts:230
        B-->>C: 503 "Try again later"
    else Actions Agent restarted (task lost)
        B->>A: SendMessage (taskId, decision)
        A-->>B: JSON-RPC error TaskNotFound
        Note over B: pendingConfirmation dropped<br/>src/agent/bankAgent.ts:233
        B-->>C: "Expired, nothing was changed"
    end
